{"record_type": "article_reading", "schema_version": "0.2.0", "corpus_sha256": "E8617186FB3A82FD117C790499191B0E7B14D7A0C06E084C6D91CB5C5BF6AAA4", "article_id": "8b7d8f0d-6072-5703-bf27-dfe5c3284c5d", "source_ordinal": 182, "reading_ordinal": 3878, "source_version": "v2-current", "metadata": {"title": "速写", "published_at": "2026-04-23T19:00:00+08:00", "platform": "zhihu", "url": "https://www.zhihu.com/question/29257445/answer/2022075668876260632"}, "structure": {"full_text_checked": true, "paragraphs": [{"paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "index": 1, "text": "速写就是画家的“街拍”。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 12}, {"paragraph_id": "P002", "field": "body", "index": 2, "text": "在瞬间“速读”对象，抓住最要害、最“纲要”的视觉元素，用最简练的手法将对象的形态、动态、气质甚至质感记录下来。", "char_start": 13, "char_end": 68}, {"paragraph_id": "P003", "field": "body", "index": 3, "text": "就这么几笔，这个人、物、景、情、势就立住了。再稍微涂抹，光、影、质感也都留住了。即使此刻离场，就凭着这极简的框架，也已经可以补足、生发成完善的画面。", "char_start": 69, "char_end": 143}, {"paragraph_id": "P004", "field": "body", "index": 4, "text": "某种意义上说，速写是绘画的真正核心，是视觉艺术最精粹的部分。尤其是在AI已经极其善于补全画面的现在，速写几乎成了美术唯一仍然必须被掌握的核心技能。", "char_start": 145, "char_end": 218}, {"paragraph_id": "P005", "field": "body", "index": 5, "text": "可以这么说，速写的成果就是“视觉的提示词”。", "char_start": 219, "char_end": 241}, {"paragraph_id": "P006", "field": "body", "index": 6, "text": "什么你都可以省，唯独速写的功夫你省不了。", "char_start": 242, "char_end": 262}, {"paragraph_id": "P007", "field": "body", "index": 7, "text": "而有强大的速写功底，在AI的帮助下，你可以获得常人难以想象的“画面自由”。", "char_start": 263, "char_end": 300}, {"paragraph_id": "P008", "field": "body", "index": 8, "text": "缺的只有故事而已了。", "char_start": 301, "char_end": 311}], "images": [{"image_id": "IMG001", "src": "https://pica.zhimg.com/50/v2-b7bf7e318a3d90acc6b3d30a22adf180_720w.jpg?source=2c26e567", "status": "pending", "ocr_text": "", "visual_notes": ""}, {"image_id": "IMG002", "src": "https://picx.zhimg.com/50/v2-49c25e044c70644eb3c911686c49f548_720w.jpg?source=2c26e567", "status": "pending", "ocr_text": "", "visual_notes": ""}, {"image_id": "IMG003", "src": "https://picx.zhimg.com/50/v2-f0473e412bac29ba50ae0f51025e35e9_720w.jpg?source=2c26e567", "status": "pending", "ocr_text": "", "visual_notes": ""}, {"image_id": "IMG004", "src": "https://picx.zhimg.com/50/v2-08fdd0795c98ca49662292a62b119c53_720w.jpg?source=2c26e567", "status": "pending", "ocr_text": "", "visual_notes": ""}, {"image_id": "IMG005", "src": "https://pic1.zhimg.com/50/v2-7a3db85d67326950836ef81f0116b097_720w.jpg?source=2c26e567", "status": "pending", "ocr_text": "", "visual_notes": ""}], "lexical": {"node_counts": {"paragraph": 17, "image": 5}, "divergence": false, "divergence_count": 0}}, "reading": {"status": "needs_reread", "reader_id": "deepseek-v4.1-flash", "started_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "completed_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "image_checked": false, "batch_id": "r001-b0553"}, "analysis": {"question_context": "提问者问题：速写是一种什么样的形式，或者说什么是速写？；本文初读记录作者正文线索。", "content_units": [{"unit_id": "U001", "paragraph_refs": ["P001", "P002", "P003", "P004", "P005", "P006", "P007", "P008"], "summary": "围绕“速写”的原文驱动初步概括，待独立复核。", "role": "thesis"}], "main_claims": [{"claim_id": "C001", "claim_type": "author_explicit", "attribution": "author", "modality": "asserted", "statement": "作者开篇提出：“速写就是画家的“街拍”。”", "evidence_refs": ["E001"]}], "argument_steps": ["从开篇命题进入正文。", "其余步骤待独立复核。"], "concept_usage": [], "examples_and_targets": [], "conditions": [], "rhetoric_and_tone": "初读未作完整修辞分类，待复核。", "unresolved_questions": ["论证、事实依据与概念边界需复核。"]}, "provisional_tags": {"status": "provisional", "domain_candidates": [], "issue_candidates": [], "text_function_candidates": [], "object_candidates": [], "working_keywords": []}, "evidence_refs": [{"evidence_id": "E001", "paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "paragraph_index": 1, "quote": "速写就是画家的“街拍”。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 12, "relation": "supports"}], "notes": "原文驱动最低限度初读；尚未完成逐段独立复核。 含图片节点，图片未经核验。"}
{"record_type": "article_reading", "schema_version": "0.2.0", "corpus_sha256": "E8617186FB3A82FD117C790499191B0E7B14D7A0C06E084C6D91CB5C5BF6AAA4", "article_id": "54bddf76-d455-56f4-be50-d253b1e729ed", "source_ordinal": 179, "reading_ordinal": 3879, "source_version": "v2-current", "metadata": {"title": "剖白", "published_at": "2026-04-24T07:00:00+08:00", "platform": "afdian", "url": "https://www.ifdian.net/p/f638dd6439bc11f1878352540025c377"}, "structure": {"full_text_checked": true, "paragraphs": [{"paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "index": 1, "text": "坦诚，不是指把自己的隐私一股脑倒出来，而是指把自己的意图坦率的剖露出来。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 36}, {"paragraph_id": "P002", "field": "body", "index": 2, "text": "我知道你想要安全，但这种安全有两个做法。", "char_start": 37, "char_end": 57}, {"paragraph_id": "P003", "field": "body", "index": 3, "text": "一种是我将我的打算坦诚相告，这样你就知道我要做什么，你也可以根据我的行为来判断我是不是确实在这么做。并且为了消除你的顾虑，我可能会采用提供抵押、签署特定的违约条款、提供退出机制等等的手段，让你可以借助事情本身的安排，获得你想要的安全。", "char_start": 58, "char_end": 175}, {"paragraph_id": "P004", "field": "body", "index": 4, "text": "另一种方式就是我说什么你都不信，给你什么条件你都认定是设计，你只相信一种方法，就是我接受你的全面监视，对你交代一切情况、并且不能以任何形式反对这种监控。", "char_start": 176, "char_end": 252}, {"paragraph_id": "P005", "field": "body", "index": 5, "text": "类似“要交代全部过去和现在的细节”就是这种安全模式的实践。", "char_start": 253, "char_end": 282}, {"paragraph_id": "P006", "field": "body", "index": 6, "text": "但这种安全模式有一个巨大的悖论——在双方都可以自由选择的前提下，如果你完全不相信我的任何陈述和约定，以你我如此恶劣的关系，我有何合理的理由要再付出如此大的代价来让你安心呢？", "char_start": 283, "char_end": 369}, {"paragraph_id": "P007", "field": "body", "index": 7, "text": "它会导致“鸡生蛋还是蛋生鸡”的问题——不了解清楚一切就不能确定关系，而没有确定关系又凭什么刺探一切？", "char_start": 370, "char_end": 420}, {"paragraph_id": "P008", "field": "body", "index": 8, "text": "何况，对方如此这般跟你从头到尾说了一遍，你又如何断定这就是全部事实呢？", "char_start": 421, "char_end": 456}, {"paragraph_id": "P009", "field": "body", "index": 9, "text": "这条路根本走不通。", "char_start": 457, "char_end": 466}, {"paragraph_id": "P010", "field": "body", "index": 10, "text": "坦诚指的是坦承意图和计划，不是指交代隐私。", "char_start": 467, "char_end": 488}, {"paragraph_id": "P011", "field": "body", "index": 11, "text": "我坦率的告诉你，我的打算是我的部队要从你这里借一条路通过，我对你没有敌意，还会补偿你的配合。", "char_start": 489, "char_end": 535}, {"paragraph_id": "P012", "field": "body", "index": 12, "text": "你不放心，那么我提出我的部队人枪分离，人走人的，枪走枪的。人坐你提供的大巴就行，从你这一侧边境口岸上车，你可以安排搜身核验。还可以分成一小波一小波的渐次运输。你喜欢的话，在车底装炸弹都行。", "char_start": 536, "char_end": 630}, {"paragraph_id": "P013", "field": "body", "index": 13, "text": "你看，我有向你提供什么隐私吗？", "char_start": 631, "char_end": 646}, {"paragraph_id": "P014", "field": "body", "index": 14, "text": "没有。", "char_start": 647, "char_end": 650}, {"paragraph_id": "P015", "field": "body", "index": 15, "text": "我所做的就是通过主动提出方案来增强你对我意图的信心。我的意图是坦率的，是负责任的，如果你发现我的意愿与所述不符，根据我的主动建议，你有一切办法保证你自己不吃亏。", "char_start": 651, "char_end": 731}, {"paragraph_id": "P016", "field": "body", "index": 16, "text": "这就叫“剖白意图”，而不是“出卖隐私”。", "char_start": 732, "char_end": 752}, {"paragraph_id": "P017", "field": "body", "index": 17, "text": "你根本不需了解我的隐私，我的过去。如果此时此刻我跟你说：“我把我从小到大所有的事情告诉你一遍，但这些条款全都收回，可以吗？”", "char_start": 753, "char_end": 815}, {"paragraph_id": "P018", "field": "body", "index": 18, "text": "你会答应这个条件，并且视为得到了更好的安全保障吗？", "char_start": 816, "char_end": 841}, {"paragraph_id": "P019", "field": "body", "index": 19, "text": "发现了吗？", "char_start": 842, "char_end": 847}, {"paragraph_id": "P020", "field": "body", "index": 20, "text": "真正解决信任问题的其实是这些令人自然信任的担保措施设计，而不是隐私披露。", "char_start": 848, "char_end": 884}, {"paragraph_id": "P021", "field": "body", "index": 21, "text": "事实上，往往是人们不愿意背负复杂的担保措施，才想要用披露隐私的方法节省自己的成本和风险。", "char_start": 885, "char_end": 929}, {"paragraph_id": "P022", "field": "body", "index": 22, "text": "披露隐私换少给担保，其实这是在占便宜了。", "char_start": 930, "char_end": 950}], "images": [], "lexical": {"node_counts": {"paragraph": 24}, "divergence": false, "divergence_count": 0}}, "reading": {"status": "read", "reader_id": "deepseek-v4.1-flash", "started_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "completed_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "image_checked": false, "batch_id": "r001-b0553"}, "analysis": {"question_context": "提问者问题：有回答说过往的事没必要和对方说，也没必要问，和这篇文章中说的坦诚好像不太一样，请问可以解释一下吗？；本文初读记录作者正文线索。", "content_units": [{"unit_id": "U001", "paragraph_refs": ["P001", "P002", "P003", "P004", "P005", "P006", "P007", "P008", "P009", "P010", "P011", "P012", "P013", "P014", "P015", "P016", "P017", "P018", "P019", "P020", "P021", "P022"], "summary": "围绕“剖白”的原文驱动初步概括，待独立复核。", "role": "thesis"}], "main_claims": [{"claim_id": "C001", "claim_type": "author_explicit", "attribution": "author", "modality": "asserted", "statement": "作者开篇提出：“坦诚，不是指把自己的隐私一股脑倒出来，而是指把自己的意图坦率的剖露出来。”", "evidence_refs": ["E001"]}], "argument_steps": ["从开篇命题进入正文。", "其余步骤待独立复核。"], "concept_usage": [], "examples_and_targets": [], "conditions": [], "rhetoric_and_tone": "初读未作完整修辞分类，待复核。", "unresolved_questions": ["论证、事实依据与概念边界需复核。"]}, "provisional_tags": {"status": "provisional", "domain_candidates": [], "issue_candidates": [], "text_function_candidates": [], "object_candidates": [], "working_keywords": []}, "evidence_refs": [{"evidence_id": "E001", "paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "paragraph_index": 1, "quote": "坦诚，不是指把自己的隐私一股脑倒出来，而是指把自己的意图坦率的剖露出来。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 36, "relation": "supports"}], "notes": "原文驱动最低限度初读；尚未完成逐段独立复核。"}
{"record_type": "article_reading", "schema_version": "0.2.0", "corpus_sha256": "E8617186FB3A82FD117C790499191B0E7B14D7A0C06E084C6D91CB5C5BF6AAA4", "article_id": "88e5e5c3-52de-5637-a706-977a25c4d828", "source_ordinal": 178, "reading_ordinal": 3880, "source_version": "v2-current", "metadata": {"title": "家务教育", "published_at": "2026-04-26T07:00:00+08:00", "platform": "afdian", "url": "https://www.ifdian.net/p/d7388ddc3b6111f18e3952540025c377"}, "structure": {"full_text_checked": true, "paragraphs": [{"paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "index": 1, "text": "问题很大啊……", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 7}, {"paragraph_id": "P002", "field": "body", "index": 2, "text": "家务分几块——做饭做菜、收纳整理、维修安装、清洁保养（扫地擦窗、洗锅洗碗洗衣等）。", "char_start": 8, "char_end": 49}, {"paragraph_id": "P003", "field": "body", "index": 3, "text": "这其中，清洁保养和部分非常专业的安装（如空调、洗衣机的安装）是适合外包的。", "char_start": 50, "char_end": 87}, {"paragraph_id": "P004", "field": "body", "index": 4, "text": "但做饭做菜、收纳整理和常规维修安装，是应该亲手操作、甚至要精通的。", "char_start": 88, "char_end": 121}, {"paragraph_id": "P005", "field": "body", "index": 5, "text": "因为这些东西对于人生乐趣有很大的决定性意义——一个爱做饭、喜欢收纳整理、善于亲手安装、改造设备设施的人，无疑是一个热爱生活的人。", "char_start": 122, "char_end": 186}, {"paragraph_id": "P006", "field": "body", "index": 6, "text": "先谈做饭，自己做自己吃，可以花很多心思、做很多实验——例如有没有试过用梅子蒸豆腐？酒糟蚕豆配黄鱼？", "char_start": 187, "char_end": 236}, {"paragraph_id": "P007", "field": "body", "index": 7, "text": "自己挑选食材，亲手操作，做出自己满意的食物，最后总结出食谱，这是会带来非常踏实的现实感的幸福体验，对抵御认知失调和价值虚无化导致的抑郁倾向有相当有效的正面价值。", "char_start": 237, "char_end": 317}, {"paragraph_id": "P008", "field": "body", "index": 8, "text": "人只知道坐等现成的吃，是体会不到美食美在何处、好在何处的，很难通过亲手的对比获得对细微美感的敏感性。而提高对细节美感的敏感性，是看待事物时获得积极体验的关键技能。而从便宜的食材亲手创造出不亚于昂贵商业作品的美味，也能让人直观的体验到创造价值的实感。", "char_start": 318, "char_end": 442}, {"paragraph_id": "P009", "field": "body", "index": 9, "text": "亲手创造了价值、直接送进了自己嘴里、亲自品尝了价值，人就很少会再去问“我到底有什么价值”“人生有什么意义”——厨师和医生一样，都是可以救活人命的职业，世界上最不缺意义感的就是这两个职业。医生你不读个七八年医科体验不了，而厨师却是你走个五米远到厨房就能立刻操作的体验。平白错过，尤其是你还是中国人，简直暴殄天物。", "char_start": 443, "char_end": 598}, {"paragraph_id": "P010", "field": "body", "index": 10, "text": "你要是四川人、广东人，还要罪加一等。", "char_start": 599, "char_end": 617}, {"paragraph_id": "P011", "field": "body", "index": 11, "text": "第二是收纳整理。", "char_start": 619, "char_end": 627}, {"paragraph_id": "P012", "field": "body", "index": 12, "text": "你仔细观察，内务整洁、物品井井有条的人是很少抑郁的。抑郁的人往往是东西乱七八糟，能从不同角落里扫出半斤笔、四五把剪刀、n个瓶盖、有五六只凑不成对的袜子、一堆不是缺上册就是缺下册的残缺书本的人。", "char_start": 628, "char_end": 724}, {"paragraph_id": "P013", "field": "body", "index": 13, "text": "电脑里的文件也是一团糟，天知道什么文件在哪里。", "char_start": 725, "char_end": 748}, {"paragraph_id": "P014", "field": "body", "index": 14, "text": "对自身的认知失调，是从自身环境的失序开始，从不知道自己有多少笔、那本书在哪里、之前那个文件在哪里开始。", "char_start": 749, "char_end": 800}, {"paragraph_id": "P015", "field": "body", "index": 15, "text": "不断的重新整理自己的财产、工具，是为自己直接注入负熵、获得有序性的过程。持续优化自己的物品、工具结构，就是一个自我改善、提升的过程，会给人注入强大的积极情绪刺激。", "char_start": 801, "char_end": 882}, {"paragraph_id": "P016", "field": "body", "index": 16, "text": "在自己亲手维护的窗明几净、一切闭着眼睛都伸手可得的环境里，干什么都流畅丝滑，自然干什么都效率更高、结果更乐观。", "char_start": 883, "char_end": 938}, {"paragraph_id": "P017", "field": "body", "index": 17, "text": "结果你可倒好，这个也给禁掉了。", "char_start": 939, "char_end": 954}, {"paragraph_id": "P018", "field": "body", "index": 18, "text": "第三是维修安装。", "char_start": 956, "char_end": 964}, {"paragraph_id": "P019", "field": "body", "index": 19, "text": "替换三角阀、安装水龙头、拆装垃圾粉碎机、维修屋内电路，制作水晶头、修理淋浴、组装和改造板式家具……这都需要大量的测量、规划、操作、补救的功夫，对于锻炼人的耐心、规划能力、创造性能力、执行能力、情绪管理能力有非常显著的效果。", "char_start": 965, "char_end": 1076}, {"paragraph_id": "P020", "field": "body", "index": 20, "text": "这些东西有学习和抽象思考所不能提供的教育和启发意义，对于子女的心理韧性、认知能力和操作能力、乐观主义精神都有很大的促进作用。", "char_start": 1077, "char_end": 1139}, {"paragraph_id": "P021", "field": "body", "index": 21, "text": "真正繁重的家务只有几乎每天都要做的清洁工作，这个外包给洗碗机、扫地机器人和洗衣机好了。把这部分去掉，学习甚至精通其他的家务是利大于弊的。", "char_start": 1140, "char_end": 1208}, {"paragraph_id": "P022", "field": "body", "index": 22, "text": "为了争那么一点“学习时间”，却错过了这些刺激孩子心理发育的黄金机会，其实是在吃亏。", "char_start": 1209, "char_end": 1250}, {"paragraph_id": "P023", "field": "body", "index": 23, "text": "一旦孩子因为心理发育不充分陷入抑郁，你之前省下的时间都要加十倍甚至百倍、千倍的亏损掉。", "char_start": 1251, "char_end": 1294}, {"paragraph_id": "P024", "field": "body", "index": 24, "text": "你觉得有没有问题？", "char_start": 1295, "char_end": 1304}, {"paragraph_id": "P025", "field": "body", "index": 25, "text": "多想想吧。", "char_start": 1305, "char_end": 1310}], "images": [], "lexical": {"node_counts": {"paragraph": 27}, "divergence": false, "divergence_count": 0}}, "reading": {"status": "read", "reader_id": "deepseek-v4.1-flash", "started_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "completed_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "image_checked": false, "batch_id": "r001-b0553"}, "analysis": {"question_context": "提问者问题：我不让我女儿做家务或者学习任何的家务，我有问题吗？；本文初读记录作者正文线索。", "content_units": [{"unit_id": "U001", "paragraph_refs": ["P001", "P002", "P003", "P004", "P005", "P006", "P007", "P008", "P009", "P010", "P011", "P012", "P013", "P014", "P015", "P016", "P017", "P018", "P019", "P020", "P021", "P022", "P023", "P024", "P025"], "summary": "围绕“家务教育”的原文驱动初步概括，待独立复核。", "role": "thesis"}], "main_claims": [{"claim_id": "C001", "claim_type": "author_explicit", "attribution": "author", "modality": "asserted", "statement": "作者开篇提出：“问题很大啊……”", "evidence_refs": ["E001"]}], "argument_steps": ["从开篇命题进入正文。", "其余步骤待独立复核。"], "concept_usage": [], "examples_and_targets": [], "conditions": [], "rhetoric_and_tone": "初读未作完整修辞分类，待复核。", "unresolved_questions": ["论证、事实依据与概念边界需复核。"]}, "provisional_tags": {"status": "provisional", "domain_candidates": [], "issue_candidates": [], "text_function_candidates": [], "object_candidates": [], "working_keywords": []}, "evidence_refs": [{"evidence_id": "E001", "paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "paragraph_index": 1, "quote": "问题很大啊……", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 7, "relation": "supports"}], "notes": "原文驱动最低限度初读；尚未完成逐段独立复核。"}
{"record_type": "article_reading", "schema_version": "0.2.0", "corpus_sha256": "E8617186FB3A82FD117C790499191B0E7B14D7A0C06E084C6D91CB5C5BF6AAA4", "article_id": "df41ffb6-6f13-5218-8142-041b703e7720", "source_ordinal": 177, "reading_ordinal": 3881, "source_version": "v2-current", "metadata": {"title": "左舵三", "published_at": "2026-04-27T07:00:00+08:00", "platform": "afdian", "url": "https://www.ifdian.net/p/c316a3083c2311f1ba8352540025c377"}, "structure": {"full_text_checked": true, "paragraphs": [{"paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "index": 1, "text": "你有没有听说过帝王蟹？", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 11}, {"paragraph_id": "P002", "field": "body", "index": 2, "text": "看到帝王蟹和雪蟹有什么不同了吗？", "char_start": 13, "char_end": 29}, {"paragraph_id": "P003", "field": "body", "index": 3, "text": "帝王蟹少一对足。而且如果你把它翻过来看肚子，会发现它的“肚脐”——即退化后的尾——是歪向一侧的，而不像雪蟹那样是居中对称的。", "char_start": 30, "char_end": 92}, {"paragraph_id": "P004", "field": "body", "index": 4, "text": "它实际上不是螃蟹，而是一种远古寄居蟹的后代。", "char_start": 93, "char_end": 115}, {"paragraph_id": "P005", "field": "body", "index": 5, "text": "其实还不止帝王蟹，在水底有大量长得很像螃蟹的物种，其实都不是螃蟹，而是其他的甲壳类动物演化成了螃蟹的样子。", "char_start": 116, "char_end": 169}, {"paragraph_id": "P006", "field": "body", "index": 6, "text": "这就是著名的“蟹化现象”——一个典型的趋同演化机制的实例。", "char_start": 170, "char_end": 199}, {"paragraph_id": "P007", "field": "body", "index": 7, "text": "你“重复父母的相处模式”的根本原因，绝大部分都是因为趋同演化效应。而不是出于什么“命运的诅咒”“基因遗传”“有其父必有其子”。", "char_start": 200, "char_end": 263}, {"paragraph_id": "P008", "field": "body", "index": 8, "text": "你先要把这些迷信去掉，这很重要。因为如果你觉得问题是出自那些神秘主义的、遗传性的因素，在你认同这个想法的那一刻，你就已经进入了“适应这个现实”的心理进程，最后的结果往往是挣扎一段时间后“接受宿命”。", "char_start": 265, "char_end": 364}, {"paragraph_id": "P009", "field": "body", "index": 9, "text": "毕竟如果是基因造成的，基因怎么改呢？", "char_start": 365, "char_end": 383}, {"paragraph_id": "P010", "field": "body", "index": 10, "text": "你要相信，你只是在一个极其类似的处境下被几乎相同的几种力量——习俗、文化、经验、法律……——推入了同一个轨道，于是在这个轨道里实现了和父辈很相似的轨迹。", "char_start": 384, "char_end": 460}, {"paragraph_id": "P011", "field": "body", "index": 11, "text": "这不是什么遗传，而是环境因素导致的。环境类似，导致你的适应也类似。", "char_start": 461, "char_end": 494}, {"paragraph_id": "P012", "field": "body", "index": 12, "text": "但也只是“类似”而已。", "char_start": 495, "char_end": 506}, {"paragraph_id": "P013", "field": "body", "index": 13, "text": "你和父母有七八分像，但有两三分不同。这七八分像让你非常恐慌，那是因为你原本期待和父母有天翻地覆的差别，要看上去犹如截然相反的两个物种，结果有七八分相似，这让你大惊失色，甚至会让你觉得你的两三分不同毫无意义。", "char_start": 507, "char_end": 610}, {"paragraph_id": "P014", "field": "body", "index": 14, "text": "这是错的。", "char_start": 611, "char_end": 616}, {"paragraph_id": "P015", "field": "body", "index": 15, "text": "是你一开始“期待和父母截然相反”这里就错了。你那时那样期待，只是在不了解父母面对的完整压力的前提下、作为这个压力的最终“受害者”，误认为父母不是出于不得已，而是出于主观的不努力、不愿意。", "char_start": 617, "char_end": 710}, {"paragraph_id": "P016", "field": "body", "index": 16, "text": "你现在自己面对完整的压力了，会发现其实自己自认为可以完全不同的那个自信本身是过于傲慢的。同样的矛盾，换了你来，你也只比父母有两三分不同而已，做不到天差地别、判若云泥。", "char_start": 711, "char_end": 794}, {"paragraph_id": "P017", "field": "body", "index": 17, "text": "但两三分不同，也是不同。", "char_start": 795, "char_end": 807}, {"paragraph_id": "P018", "field": "body", "index": 18, "text": "两三分不同，已经足够让经年累月积累后的结果有天壤之别。", "char_start": 808, "char_end": 835}, {"paragraph_id": "P019", "field": "body", "index": 19, "text": "其实这“只有两三分不同”的体感，就是“最终结果天差地别”的正确对应感受。", "char_start": 836, "char_end": 872}, {"paragraph_id": "P020", "field": "body", "index": 20, "text": "你唯一要做的，就是坚持这“七八分相似、两三分改善”的正确努力，把其它的交给时间。", "char_start": 873, "char_end": 913}, {"paragraph_id": "P021", "field": "body", "index": 21, "text": "这就像万吨巨轮，左满舵，也只能做到一分钟航向角偏转5度。你可能觉得“几乎没有改变”，但你只要把住舵轮不放，只要18分钟，你就可以转一个90度的弯，从向南转为向东。", "char_start": 914, "char_end": 995}, {"paragraph_id": "P022", "field": "body", "index": 22, "text": "这就是“转急弯”应有的感觉。", "char_start": 996, "char_end": 1010}, {"paragraph_id": "P023", "field": "body", "index": 23, "text": "“两三分不同”，就是“天壤之别”。你不会因为和父母“差不多”的行为方式而走向一样的结局。", "char_start": 1011, "char_end": 1055}, {"paragraph_id": "P024", "field": "body", "index": 24, "text": "你会因为这两三分的差别走向一个完全不同的结局。", "char_start": 1056, "char_end": 1079}, {"paragraph_id": "P025", "field": "body", "index": 25, "text": "坚持你觉得正确的改变，不要为“我还是做了和父辈相似的事”而过度懊悔。", "char_start": 1080, "char_end": 1114}, {"paragraph_id": "P026", "field": "body", "index": 26, "text": "继续走下去，学会对“一分钟只偏5度”的进展感到满意、感到惊喜。", "char_start": 1115, "char_end": 1146}, {"paragraph_id": "P027", "field": "body", "index": 27, "text": "学会了，你才会继续坚持，才走得到“坚持了18分钟，完全走向其它结局”的结果。", "char_start": 1147, "char_end": 1185}, {"paragraph_id": "P028", "field": "body", "index": 28, "text": "瞧不起“这点差别”，就会松劲、会放弃，甚至会反打方向，那才真的需要担心了。", "char_start": 1186, "char_end": 1223}, {"paragraph_id": "P029", "field": "body", "index": 29, "text": "你和父母有差别——10%的差别并不是“无关紧要的误差”，而是重大差异。", "char_start": 1224, "char_end": 1259}, {"paragraph_id": "P030", "field": "body", "index": 30, "text": "一切正常，左舵三，继续前进。", "char_start": 1260, "char_end": 1274}], "images": [{"image_id": "IMG001", "src": "https://asset.sooon.ai/p/2026-04/20/d28a4999-3f2a-44d4-ab98-2c3e9045cb4a.webp", "status": "pending", "ocr_text": "", "visual_notes": ""}], "lexical": {"node_counts": {"paragraph": 33, "image": 1}, "divergence": false, "divergence_count": 0}}, "reading": {"status": "needs_reread", "reader_id": "deepseek-v4.1-flash", "started_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "completed_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "image_checked": false, "batch_id": "r001-b0553"}, "analysis": {"question_context": "提问者问题：自己跟伴侣的关系好像在无意中「重复父母的相处模式」，原生家庭的强迫性重复怎么解？；本文初读记录作者正文线索。", "content_units": [{"unit_id": "U001", "paragraph_refs": ["P001", "P002", "P003", "P004", "P005", "P006", "P007", "P008", "P009", "P010", "P011", "P012", "P013", "P014", "P015", "P016", "P017", "P018", "P019", "P020", "P021", "P022", "P023", "P024", "P025", "P026", "P027", "P028", "P029", "P030"], "summary": "围绕“左舵三”的原文驱动初步概括，待独立复核。", "role": "thesis"}], "main_claims": [{"claim_id": "C001", "claim_type": "author_explicit", "attribution": "author", "modality": "asserted", "statement": "作者开篇提出：“你有没有听说过帝王蟹？”", "evidence_refs": ["E001"]}], "argument_steps": ["从开篇命题进入正文。", "其余步骤待独立复核。"], "concept_usage": [], "examples_and_targets": [], "conditions": [], "rhetoric_and_tone": "初读未作完整修辞分类，待复核。", "unresolved_questions": ["论证、事实依据与概念边界需复核。"]}, "provisional_tags": {"status": "provisional", "domain_candidates": [], "issue_candidates": [], "text_function_candidates": [], "object_candidates": [], "working_keywords": []}, "evidence_refs": [{"evidence_id": "E001", "paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "paragraph_index": 1, "quote": "你有没有听说过帝王蟹？", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 11, "relation": "supports"}], "notes": "原文驱动最低限度初读；尚未完成逐段独立复核。 含图片节点，图片未经核验。"}
{"record_type": "article_reading", "schema_version": "0.2.0", "corpus_sha256": "E8617186FB3A82FD117C790499191B0E7B14D7A0C06E084C6D91CB5C5BF6AAA4", "article_id": "e48bb30e-cb92-5206-8122-1d86eb29d863", "source_ordinal": 176, "reading_ordinal": 3882, "source_version": "v2-current", "metadata": {"title": "爱有所止", "published_at": "2026-04-29T07:00:00+08:00", "platform": "afdian", "url": "https://www.ifdian.net/p/becfefe43dbc11f1b9f652540025c377"}, "structure": {"full_text_checked": true, "paragraphs": [{"paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "quote", "index": 1, "text": "提问者发现自己对朋友不同的困难有不同的反应。\n如朋友甲会初步解决自己的心理和情绪问题，找笔者倾诉也带一种辛酸的洒脱，虽然也在讲述自己的困难和疑问，但没有“抱怨”之感，笔者就会认真给予情绪疏导和实质性帮助。\n朋友乙在很辛苦、很痛苦的时候，会时常给笔者倾诉其ta的痛苦、后悔情绪和吐槽周围遇见的人和事，但笔者总是置之不理。觉得“为什么不认真走下去反而一直抱怨困难，多出如此多不必要的抱怨和情绪”，然后不予理会。\n笔者认为这两位朋友之间的困难有本质区别，前者是个人无法抵抗的，后者是自己的不正确心态和认知导致的，对后者完全没有给予关心的耐心。笔者曾多次对朋友乙鼓励和安慰，提出解决办法和心态转变，但朋友乙依", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 502, "sample_truncated": true}, {"paragraph_id": "P002", "field": "body", "index": 2, "text": "朋友遇到挫折，进而有了消极情绪，然后来求助，你作为朋友，有一定救助义务。于是你救了一次，并且给出了“如何避免进一步受害”的参考意见。结果你发现对方没有采用这个意见，还在一而再再而三的遭遇同样的挫折，不断重复“吃亏-找朋友吸能-恢复如初-再次吃同样亏”的循环。", "char_start": 503, "char_end": 632}, {"paragraph_id": "P003", "field": "body", "index": 3, "text": "同样的恐惧其实父母们早就经历过。子女在重复一种错误的行为，但因为自己的无条件兜底为子女撑起了一个可以持续的循环。每一轮的伤害和损失其实最终都是父母们承受了，而子女因为没有多少实际后果，得以不断的重复。", "char_start": 633, "char_end": 733}, {"paragraph_id": "P004", "field": "body", "index": 4, "text": "损失只是一方面，更深刻的痛苦，是怀疑自己正在化为对方持续受伤、持续堕落的赞助者。如果没有我一次次的修复、填补，也许这个循环还不至于持续这么久。", "char_start": 734, "char_end": 805}, {"paragraph_id": "P005", "field": "body", "index": 5, "text": "仔细算一算，这种循环里面到底有谁在受益？", "char_start": 806, "char_end": 826}, {"paragraph_id": "P006", "field": "body", "index": 6, "text": "受损如果可以换你改善，那么受损可以算作朋友之义、父母之情。", "char_start": 827, "char_end": 856}, {"paragraph_id": "P007", "field": "body", "index": 7, "text": "但如果受损不但换不到你改善，还会换你重复失败，那么这算是什么呢？", "char_start": 857, "char_end": 889}, {"paragraph_id": "P008", "field": "body", "index": 8, "text": "到了这个时候，你就会产生巨大的迷茫和犹豫，而且这个模式重复越多次，你的犹豫和退缩就会越甚，直到转向焦虑、反感，甚至厌恶和愤怒。", "char_start": 890, "char_end": 953}, {"paragraph_id": "P009", "field": "body", "index": 9, "text": "这种情绪是难以抑制的，因为这其实是自然法在借着这机制禁止人利用别人的爱来纵容自己的软弱，也禁止别人利用自己的爱来沉沦在软弱中。", "char_start": 954, "char_end": 1017}, {"paragraph_id": "P010", "field": "body", "index": 10, "text": "这是自然法的禁令，你的情绪只是自然法勒令你依命行事的驱动手段罢了。", "char_start": 1018, "char_end": 1051}, {"paragraph_id": "P011", "field": "body", "index": 11, "text": "这意味着人要借着爱喘息、修复，同时就有义务要对爱交出自己在努力避免滥用爱的证明。", "char_start": 1052, "char_end": 1092}, {"paragraph_id": "P012", "field": "body", "index": 12, "text": "珍惜的证明。", "char_start": 1093, "char_end": 1099}, {"paragraph_id": "P013", "field": "body", "index": 13, "text": "爱是用血汗挤出来的，可以无偿，但绝不允许被浪费，更不允许被滥用于维持错误。", "char_start": 1100, "char_end": 1137}, {"paragraph_id": "P014", "field": "body", "index": 14, "text": "你必须拿出努力的实质痕迹来维持对方对持续付出的热情，这不是对方没有亲情、不讲友情，而是自然法的强制要求。你不拿出应分的努力来证实对方的付出被珍惜、在起着正面的效用，自然法就会强行没收ta们对你的感情，即使ta们本人反对、本人不情愿都没有用。", "char_start": 1138, "char_end": 1258}, {"paragraph_id": "P015", "field": "body", "index": 15, "text": "所以，你没有做错什么——在你履行了几次义务之后，维持你继续履行义务的热情的责任就落到了对方一边。", "char_start": 1259, "char_end": 1307}, {"paragraph_id": "P016", "field": "body", "index": 16, "text": "即使是父母，也受到同样的规则约束而无法抗拒，你没必要过于自疑了。", "char_start": 1308, "char_end": 1340}, {"paragraph_id": "P017", "field": "body", "index": 17, "text": "爱不但不该是继续坚持，反而应该是尽快结束。", "char_start": 1342, "char_end": 1363}, {"paragraph_id": "P018", "field": "body", "index": 18, "text": "即使是父母也无法接受这样的安排，何况是朋友呢？", "char_start": 1364, "char_end": 1387}], "images": [], "lexical": {"node_counts": {"quote": 1, "paragraph": 20}, "divergence": false, "divergence_count": 0}}, "reading": {"status": "read", "reader_id": "deepseek-v4.1-flash", "started_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "completed_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "image_checked": false, "batch_id": "r001-b0553"}, "analysis": {"question_context": "提问者问题：轻视朋友的痛苦是否意味着我并不是对方的朋友？；本文初读记录作者正文线索。", "content_units": [{"unit_id": "U001", "paragraph_refs": ["P001", "P002", "P003", "P004", "P005", "P006", "P007", "P008", "P009", "P010", "P011", "P012", "P013", "P014", "P015", "P016", "P017", "P018"], "summary": "围绕“爱有所止”的原文驱动初步概括，待独立复核。", "role": "thesis"}], "main_claims": [{"claim_id": "C001", "claim_type": "author_explicit", "attribution": "author", "modality": "asserted", "statement": "作者开篇提出：“提问者发现自己对朋友不同的困难有不同的反应。”", "evidence_refs": ["E001"]}], "argument_steps": ["从开篇命题进入正文。", "其余步骤待独立复核。"], "concept_usage": [], "examples_and_targets": [], "conditions": [], "rhetoric_and_tone": "初读未作完整修辞分类，待复核。", "unresolved_questions": ["论证、事实依据与概念边界需复核。"]}, "provisional_tags": {"status": "provisional", "domain_candidates": [], "issue_candidates": [], "text_function_candidates": [], "object_candidates": [], "working_keywords": []}, "evidence_refs": [{"evidence_id": "E001", "paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "quote", "paragraph_index": 1, "quote": "提问者发现自己对朋友不同的困难有不同的反应。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 502, "relation": "supports"}], "notes": "原文驱动最低限度初读；尚未完成逐段独立复核。"}
{"record_type": "article_reading", "schema_version": "0.2.0", "corpus_sha256": "E8617186FB3A82FD117C790499191B0E7B14D7A0C06E084C6D91CB5C5BF6AAA4", "article_id": "e014332c-1ff2-5ebf-b6e8-078a78d9a853", "source_ordinal": 173, "reading_ordinal": 3883, "source_version": "v2-current", "metadata": {"title": "小可靠", "published_at": "2026-04-29T19:00:00+08:00", "platform": "zhihu", "url": "https://www.zhihu.com/question/1889063263548986409/answer/2024581013041325094"}, "structure": {"full_text_checked": true, "paragraphs": [{"paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "index": 1, "text": "很多人都会回答“不让”。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 12}, {"paragraph_id": "P002", "field": "body", "index": 2, "text": "这似乎很顺理成章，根本就不需要什么犹豫，但其实是把问题想简单了。", "char_start": 13, "char_end": 45}, {"paragraph_id": "P003", "field": "body", "index": 3, "text": "因为这事还有一个更棘手的变体——原本已经是朋友的同学，一旦得了抑郁症，你是要让孩子跟对方断交吗？", "char_start": 46, "char_end": 94}, {"paragraph_id": "P004", "field": "body", "index": 4, "text": "发现没有？", "char_start": 95, "char_end": 100}, {"paragraph_id": "P005", "field": "body", "index": 5, "text": "既然你教ta“不能和抑郁的孩子交朋友”，自然而然就意味着你要让ta和得了抑郁症的朋友断交。", "char_start": 101, "char_end": 146}, {"paragraph_id": "P006", "field": "body", "index": 6, "text": "是的，你会说得比较委婉，说“保持距离”什么的。但你实际上就是这个打算，不是吗？", "char_start": 147, "char_end": 186}, {"paragraph_id": "P007", "field": "body", "index": 7, "text": "其实你是操不起这个心，而且感觉这样没什么说不过去的，是吗？", "char_start": 187, "char_end": 216}, {"paragraph_id": "P008", "field": "body", "index": 8, "text": "然后你从孩子的视角看看这个问题——那么所谓的“朋友”还有什么意义？", "char_start": 217, "char_end": 250}, {"paragraph_id": "P009", "field": "body", "index": 9, "text": "只有在对方蒸蒸日上的时候才能做朋友，一旦对方落难了、有困难了、得病了，就要敬而远之。", "char_start": 251, "char_end": 293}, {"paragraph_id": "P010", "field": "body", "index": 10, "text": "那么反过来，这也意味着我自己只有成绩良好、一切正常的时候才能指望朋友，一旦我自己病了、出问题了、有困难了，我也不用指望别人的友情了。我只能自己挖个洞，别成为别人的麻烦。", "char_start": 294, "char_end": 378}, {"paragraph_id": "P011", "field": "body", "index": 11, "text": "所以，在我一帆风顺、不需要朋友的时候，我才会有朋友；但当我陷入真正的危难、需要朋友的时候，我是不会有朋友的。", "char_start": 379, "char_end": 433}, {"paragraph_id": "P012", "field": "body", "index": 12, "text": "因为我本人就是这样，我受的就是这样的教育。", "char_start": 434, "char_end": 455}, {"paragraph_id": "P013", "field": "body", "index": 13, "text": "你是省了一番纠结，但是你同时把ta的抑郁概率提高了一级。", "char_start": 456, "char_end": 484}, {"paragraph_id": "P014", "field": "body", "index": 14, "text": "人没有一帆风顺、毫无低潮的。ta一旦相信“只要陷入低潮，人们就会纷纷离去”，哪怕一些普通低潮，甚至仅仅是一些向下滑落的迹象，就足以演变成深刻的个人危机。", "char_start": 485, "char_end": 561}, {"paragraph_id": "P015", "field": "body", "index": 15, "text": "ta陷入低潮时原本应该安心休息，恢复体力，养精蓄锐，等待好天气再次出航，然而因为见证了这“一旦行背运就会众叛亲离”的惨剧，ta反而会在陷入低潮时加倍的发狠、加倍的用力。", "char_start": 562, "char_end": 646}, {"paragraph_id": "P016", "field": "body", "index": 16, "text": "越是不妙，越是会在焦虑驱使下夜不能寐的“努力”；而越是“努力”，越会发现效率下降、力不从心。本来应该在朋友们的支撑下安心休养的，反而会为了保住朋友加倍劳累。", "char_start": 647, "char_end": 725}, {"paragraph_id": "P017", "field": "body", "index": 17, "text": "这是一个危险的设定，发现了吗？", "char_start": 726, "char_end": 741}, {"paragraph_id": "P018", "field": "body", "index": 18, "text": "本质上，这个“看到问题就敬而远之”的安排深刻的摧毁了友情的概念，真这么干，孩子以后对友情就没有指望和期待了。", "char_start": 742, "char_end": 796}, {"paragraph_id": "P019", "field": "body", "index": 19, "text": "对友情毫无期待，现在的人大多又没有兄弟姐妹，以后单枪匹马的面对人生变幻莫测的风云，该有多难。", "char_start": 797, "char_end": 843}, {"paragraph_id": "P020", "field": "body", "index": 20, "text": "所以你不能这么“省事”。", "char_start": 844, "char_end": 856}, {"paragraph_id": "P021", "field": "body", "index": 21, "text": "正确的做法是好好的梳理一下友情的基本逻辑。", "char_start": 857, "char_end": 878}, {"paragraph_id": "P022", "field": "body", "index": 22, "text": "首先，人对人要有基本的人道主义关怀。就是没有任何交情，遇到落难的人也要略尽薄力。这部分，咱们名都不要留，不必让人知道是谁，能做就顺手做了。", "char_start": 879, "char_end": 948}, {"paragraph_id": "P023", "field": "body", "index": 23, "text": "人家油瓶子倒了就顺手帮人扶起来；东西掉地上了看到了帮人捡起来。不分对方是谁，不是朋友也该帮一帮。", "char_start": 949, "char_end": 997}, {"paragraph_id": "P024", "field": "body", "index": 24, "text": "其次，做好友情的基本定义——友情就是保持友好、给予正面帮助，只要是保持帮助即可，不表示无限度、无原则的帮助。", "char_start": 998, "char_end": 1052}, {"paragraph_id": "P025", "field": "body", "index": 25, "text": "对所有朋友都是如此，既不是毫无戒备、两肋插刀，也不是冷如冰霜、避如蛇蝎，不要一做朋友就变前者，出点问题就变后者。", "char_start": 1053, "char_end": 1109}, {"paragraph_id": "P026", "field": "body", "index": 26, "text": "是朋友，帮不帮、怎么帮，也要就事论事、量力而行。需要考虑、有所保留，这跟“是朋友”没有矛盾。你一直肯接受对方的请求，肯做考虑，而且一旦答应就尽职尽责，就是朋友了。", "char_start": 1110, "char_end": 1191}, {"paragraph_id": "P027", "field": "body", "index": 27, "text": "你本来就不是必须要满足对方的一切需求的。", "char_start": 1192, "char_end": 1212}, {"paragraph_id": "P028", "field": "body", "index": 28, "text": "因此，即使是身患抑郁症的朋友也一样，你担心就多想一点，多帮那些清晰简洁、力所能及的忙，多跟我们父母商量报备，我们会帮你把关。", "char_start": 1213, "char_end": 1275}, {"paragraph_id": "P029", "field": "body", "index": 29, "text": "但是咱们不做那种朋友落难就四散而走的人。我们做不到啥都帮，但朋友落难总要尽一点心、一点义。", "char_start": 1276, "char_end": 1321}, {"paragraph_id": "P030", "field": "body", "index": 30, "text": "反过来，我们自己交朋友也一样，要多珍视那些在自己寒微、落难之时还能不离不弃、哪怕做不到两肋插刀、倾囊相助的朋友。", "char_start": 1322, "char_end": 1378}, {"paragraph_id": "P031", "field": "body", "index": 31, "text": "患难见真情，一有患难就跑路，还有什么真情？", "char_start": 1379, "char_end": 1400}, {"paragraph_id": "P032", "field": "body", "index": 32, "text": "而另一面，我们鸡贼一点说——患难时也是你赢得真挚友情的机会。这不单是指落难中人的友情，还包括旁观者的友情——谁不想要这么讲义气的朋友？", "char_start": 1401, "char_end": 1468}, {"paragraph_id": "P033", "field": "body", "index": 33, "text": "你就纯把这个当生意做，这时候也是一个进取的机会。", "char_start": 1469, "char_end": 1493}, {"paragraph_id": "P034", "field": "body", "index": 34, "text": "有没有风险？有。但是处理人际风险也是我们打算让你在成人之前学会的必备技能——甚至比学习英语、化学还优先。", "char_start": 1494, "char_end": 1546}, {"paragraph_id": "P035", "field": "body", "index": 35, "text": "其实你以为将来令你的恋人们、朋友们倾倒的是什么？正是你这个在危难中守节有余的经验和气度。", "char_start": 1547, "char_end": 1591}, {"paragraph_id": "P036", "field": "body", "index": 36, "text": "大家都想要有事来了身边有一个不慌的人，这个“靠得住”比这人的什么数学成绩、英语水平重要得多。", "char_start": 1592, "char_end": 1638}, {"paragraph_id": "P037", "field": "body", "index": 37, "text": "重要一万倍。", "char_start": 1639, "char_end": 1645}, {"paragraph_id": "P038", "field": "body", "index": 38, "text": "数学、英语有老师教，你学成啥样是啥样。", "char_start": 1646, "char_end": 1665}, {"paragraph_id": "P039", "field": "body", "index": 39, "text": "你这一身风流倜傥、有理有节的担当，我来带你练。", "char_start": 1666, "char_end": 1689}, {"paragraph_id": "P040", "field": "body", "index": 40, "text": "你练得好，以后不做那种一日三惊、日夜忧虑恐慌的人，数学、英语都容易学好一些。", "char_start": 1690, "char_end": 1728}, {"paragraph_id": "P041", "field": "body", "index": 41, "text": "所以，答案是“不阻止，但会加强指导”——这个心该操，操好了有收益。", "char_start": 1729, "char_end": 1762}], "images": [], "lexical": {"node_counts": {"paragraph": 41}, "divergence": false, "divergence_count": 0}}, "reading": {"status": "read", "reader_id": "deepseek-v4.1-flash", "started_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "completed_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "image_checked": false, "batch_id": "r001-b0553"}, "analysis": {"question_context": "提问者问题：如果班里有因为抑郁休学的同学，你会让孩子和他们做朋友吗？；本文初读记录作者正文线索。", "content_units": [{"unit_id": "U001", "paragraph_refs": ["P001", "P002", "P003", "P004", "P005", "P006", "P007", "P008", "P009", "P010", "P011", "P012", "P013", "P014", "P015", "P016", "P017", "P018", "P019", "P020", "P021", "P022", "P023", "P024", "P025", "P026", "P027", "P028", "P029", "P030", "P031", "P032", "P033", "P034", "P035", "P036", "P037", "P038", "P039", "P040", "P041"], "summary": "围绕“小可靠”的原文驱动初步概括，待独立复核。", "role": "thesis"}], "main_claims": [{"claim_id": "C001", "claim_type": "author_explicit", "attribution": "author", "modality": "asserted", "statement": "作者开篇提出：“很多人都会回答“不让”。”", "evidence_refs": ["E001"]}], "argument_steps": ["从开篇命题进入正文。", "其余步骤待独立复核。"], "concept_usage": [], "examples_and_targets": [], "conditions": [], "rhetoric_and_tone": "初读未作完整修辞分类，待复核。", "unresolved_questions": ["论证、事实依据与概念边界需复核。"]}, "provisional_tags": {"status": "provisional", "domain_candidates": [], "issue_candidates": [], "text_function_candidates": [], "object_candidates": [], "working_keywords": []}, "evidence_refs": [{"evidence_id": "E001", "paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "paragraph_index": 1, "quote": "很多人都会回答“不让”。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 12, "relation": "supports"}], "notes": "原文驱动最低限度初读；尚未完成逐段独立复核。"}
{"record_type": "article_reading", "schema_version": "0.2.0", "corpus_sha256": "E8617186FB3A82FD117C790499191B0E7B14D7A0C06E084C6D91CB5C5BF6AAA4", "article_id": "ee0f4cb3-1bc8-5d2f-bf54-82ad64c3c700", "source_ordinal": 174, "reading_ordinal": 3884, "source_version": "v2-current", "metadata": {"title": "不骄的兵", "published_at": "2026-04-29T19:00:00+08:00", "platform": "zhihu", "url": "https://www.zhihu.com/question/2022279139957244753/answer/2024203313726365797"}, "structure": {"full_text_checked": true, "paragraphs": [{"paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "index": 1, "text": "凡是说“必然”的，只不过是马后炮罢了。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 19}, {"paragraph_id": "P002", "field": "body", "index": 2, "text": "站在事情中间，哪有什么“必然”？", "char_start": 20, "char_end": 36}, {"paragraph_id": "P003", "field": "body", "index": 3, "text": "记者并不是必然被感动，车型并不是必然会成功，销售不是必然会顺利，售后不是必然不出问题，比赛也不是必然会胜利。", "char_start": 37, "char_end": 91}, {"paragraph_id": "P004", "field": "body", "index": 4, "text": "历史上无数胜券在握而功败垂成的案例——兵力胜过对方十倍，技术先进一代，最后却打输的战争还少吗？资本是对方十倍，人才多过对方百倍，最后却输掉的比赛还少吗？", "char_start": 92, "char_end": 168}, {"paragraph_id": "P005", "field": "body", "index": 5, "text": "杜卡迪在赛前有没有觉得自己必胜？它还不是意外败北了？", "char_start": 169, "char_end": 195}, {"paragraph_id": "P006", "field": "body", "index": 6, "text": "谁敢说什么“必然”？哪有什么“必然”？世界上根本就没有“必然”这种事。", "char_start": 196, "char_end": 231}, {"paragraph_id": "P007", "field": "body", "index": 7, "text": "我也不太相信张雪本人真的觉得自己的每一步都是“一定成”。", "char_start": 232, "char_end": 260}, {"paragraph_id": "P008", "field": "body", "index": 8, "text": "他更多的是在拼“无论如何要尽最大努力，要把我的实力充分发挥出来”。", "char_start": 261, "char_end": 294}, {"paragraph_id": "P009", "field": "body", "index": 9, "text": "付出的努力和心血太多了，都是实实在在的血汗、有实实在在的进步和验证的，我没有自欺欺人，我真的在练习场上做到过了，而且一次次的做到过，这绝不是幻觉。", "char_start": 295, "char_end": 368}, {"paragraph_id": "P010", "field": "body", "index": 10, "text": "那么我绝不接受什么偶然因素导致的失败成为我的终局，我一定要拼到尽头。", "char_start": 369, "char_end": 403}, {"paragraph_id": "P011", "field": "body", "index": 11, "text": "拼记者那一关就很明显，第一次失败了，记者不耐烦了，一般人就会觉得“我不行了”“已经不耐烦了要再说服就会更难了”——一方面我自己信心动摇了、实力消耗了，另一方面对方不耐烦了，被打动的可能性更小了，既然如此，再试一次很可能是徒耗精力，是白白浪费。", "char_start": 404, "char_end": 525}, {"paragraph_id": "P012", "field": "body", "index": 12, "text": "而张雪想的是“我还有力气再试一次”“我还有可能做到”。概率是降低了，但降低了不是不可能。", "char_start": 526, "char_end": 570}, {"paragraph_id": "P013", "field": "body", "index": 13, "text": "保留这点精力和面子，然后放弃进入摩托车队的机会吗？收益是什么？无非是省掉一次伤心、一次“羞辱”。", "char_start": 571, "char_end": 619}, {"paragraph_id": "P014", "field": "body", "index": 14, "text": "想想走到这一步用掉了多少心血，多少努力，背后背负着多少人的支持和期望，能为了少一次羞辱而不试吗？", "char_start": 620, "char_end": 668}, {"paragraph_id": "P015", "field": "body", "index": 15, "text": "尤其是我不是盲目自信，我的的确确做到过，大概率的做到过。", "char_start": 669, "char_end": 697}, {"paragraph_id": "P016", "field": "body", "index": 16, "text": "事情走到这一步，如果要失败，必须是物理性的、生理性的无法再试，除非车坏了，人残了，根本跑不起来了，否则就因为一次偶然失败而放弃，我绝不甘心。", "char_start": 698, "char_end": 768}, {"paragraph_id": "P017", "field": "body", "index": 17, "text": "你下了这么大功夫，在练习场上得到了这样的现实验证，你自然而然就会产生这种不甘心。", "char_start": 769, "char_end": 809}, {"paragraph_id": "P018", "field": "body", "index": 18, "text": "这个“不甘心”追求的并不是“一定要成功”，而是“甘心”。", "char_start": 810, "char_end": 838}, {"paragraph_id": "P019", "field": "body", "index": 19, "text": "我要把我手里的实力真正的表达出来，我才接受所谓的成功和失败的裁定，在这之前，我不接受任何偶然的结果。", "char_start": 839, "char_end": 889}, {"paragraph_id": "P020", "field": "body", "index": 20, "text": "我可以失败，但是要公平的失败，要发挥出所有实力后失败，让我甘心的失败。", "char_start": 890, "char_end": 925}, {"paragraph_id": "P021", "field": "body", "index": 21, "text": "但这并没有什么“必然”。", "char_start": 926, "char_end": 938}, {"paragraph_id": "P022", "field": "body", "index": 22, "text": "我完全可能多次遇到罕见的偶然因素，把自己的资源耗尽也没能再次发挥出那个练习场、实验室里的实力。", "char_start": 939, "char_end": 986}, {"paragraph_id": "P023", "field": "body", "index": 23, "text": "我也完全可能就是遇到一个铁石心肠，就是无法被打动。", "char_start": 987, "char_end": 1012}, {"paragraph_id": "P024", "field": "body", "index": 24, "text": "对手也可能有出人意料的进步，超过了我原本以为肯定可以超过的水平。", "char_start": 1013, "char_end": 1045}, {"paragraph_id": "P025", "field": "body", "index": 25, "text": "但我明知也承认这些可能，我也不甘心。", "char_start": 1046, "char_end": 1064}, {"paragraph_id": "P026", "field": "body", "index": 26, "text": "如果把握大到这么大的程度的风险都不肯冒，那以后还有什么事可以做呢？", "char_start": 1065, "char_end": 1098}, {"paragraph_id": "P027", "field": "body", "index": 27, "text": "哪有所谓的“必胜”“必然”？", "char_start": 1099, "char_end": 1113}, {"paragraph_id": "P028", "field": "body", "index": 28, "text": "只不过是“把握大到了胜率可以期待，不拼尽全力试试不甘心”而已。", "char_start": 1114, "char_end": 1145}, {"paragraph_id": "P029", "field": "body", "index": 29, "text": "世界上没有“必然的成功”，至少在真正成功之前是没有的。", "char_start": 1146, "char_end": 1173}, {"paragraph_id": "P030", "field": "body", "index": 30, "text": "事后看什么都“显而易见”，事前看，“有不搏一下不甘心的把握”就是最接近“必胜”的东西了。", "char_start": 1174, "char_end": 1218}, {"paragraph_id": "P031", "field": "body", "index": 31, "text": "事实上，人也最好只把自己的认知止步于此，不要自己增强到“必胜”。", "char_start": 1219, "char_end": 1251}, {"paragraph_id": "P032", "field": "body", "index": 32, "text": "“必胜”就不是哀兵而是骄兵了。", "char_start": 1252, "char_end": 1267}, {"paragraph_id": "P033", "field": "body", "index": 33, "text": "骄兵易败。", "char_start": 1268, "char_end": 1273}], "images": [], "lexical": {"node_counts": {"paragraph": 33}, "divergence": false, "divergence_count": 0}}, "reading": {"status": "read", "reader_id": "deepseek-v4.1-flash", "started_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "completed_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "image_checked": false, "batch_id": "r001-b0553"}, "analysis": {"question_context": "提问者问题：张雪机车的成功是必然还是偶然？；本文初读记录作者正文线索。", "content_units": [{"unit_id": "U001", "paragraph_refs": ["P001", "P002", "P003", "P004", "P005", "P006", "P007", "P008", "P009", "P010", "P011", "P012", "P013", "P014", "P015", "P016", "P017", "P018", "P019", "P020", "P021", "P022", "P023", "P024", "P025", "P026", "P027", "P028", "P029", "P030", "P031", "P032", "P033"], "summary": "围绕“不骄的兵”的原文驱动初步概括，待独立复核。", "role": "thesis"}], "main_claims": [{"claim_id": "C001", "claim_type": "author_explicit", "attribution": "author", "modality": "asserted", "statement": "作者开篇提出：“凡是说“必然”的，只不过是马后炮罢了。”", "evidence_refs": ["E001"]}], "argument_steps": ["从开篇命题进入正文。", "其余步骤待独立复核。"], "concept_usage": [], "examples_and_targets": [], "conditions": [], "rhetoric_and_tone": "初读未作完整修辞分类，待复核。", "unresolved_questions": ["论证、事实依据与概念边界需复核。"]}, "provisional_tags": {"status": "provisional", "domain_candidates": [], "issue_candidates": [], "text_function_candidates": [], "object_candidates": [], "working_keywords": []}, "evidence_refs": [{"evidence_id": "E001", "paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "paragraph_index": 1, "quote": "凡是说“必然”的，只不过是马后炮罢了。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 19, "relation": "supports"}], "notes": "原文驱动最低限度初读；尚未完成逐段独立复核。"}
